{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EErsvsF7jRuX8enqxnhbRg","type":"tool_result","content":"projects/struct_self_consist_ie/paper_framing.md:9:## Core Claims (4 layers, D112 updated — Main Conference framing with capability trap + degeneracy)\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/paper_framing.md:16:[Omitted long matching line]\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/paper_framing.md:18:- **Capability Trap** (unifying insight, D111): Model capability → output convergence → instance degeneracy → vanishing selection headroom. Evidence: CoNLL (91% F1) → 58% degeneracy, SciERC (66% F1) → 21%, WNUT (48% F1) → ~0%. Scale dimension: 8B → 21% degen vs 4B → 10.4% on SciERC. This is NOT an \"artifact\" — it is a **consequence of capability**, a structural inevitability. The better the model, the less test-time scaling can help via unsupervised selection.\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/paper_framing.md:20:**Distinction from MBR literature**: Eikema et al.'s MBR failure = utility function misalignment. Our failure = utility IS aligned (within-instance ρ=0.524) but headroom eliminated by degeneracy — qualitatively novel mechanism.\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/paper_framing.md:109:2. **Failure Mechanism 1 — Instance Degeneracy**: 21-58% of instances produce identical F1 across all N samples. Within-instance signals ARE correlated (ρ=0.524) but degeneracy eliminates headroom. Non-degenerate subset: MBR closes 23-41% of oracle gap. Selection recovers T=1.0 degradation (LP 0.647 vs Random 0.610, +3.7pp) but only matches greedy (0.645 macro) at 8× cost.\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/paper_framing.md:111:4. **Capability Trap** (unifying): Model capability → convergence → degeneracy → vanishing headroom. CoNLL (91% F1) → 58% degen, SciERC (66%) → 21%, WNUT (48%) → ~0%. Scale: 8B 21% vs 4B 10.4%. The better the model, the less test-time scaling helps — a structural inevitability, not an artifact.\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/paper_framing.md:112:5. **Path forward**: Breaking the capability trap requires fundamentally different approaches (trained verifiers, multi-round refinement). The non-tied subset (+2.9pp, p=0.01) proves LP selection works WHERE degeneracy is absent.\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/paper_framing.md:114:**Headline**: \"We diagnose why confidence signals that reliably predict structured IE output quality (AUROC 0.82, ρ 0.45) fail to improve over greedy decoding. Two mechanisms — instance degeneracy and logprob compression — are unified by a capability trap: the better the model, the more outputs converge, eliminating selection headroom. Multi-sample selection recovers T=1.0 sampling degradation but cannot exceed zero-cost greedy, despite 13pp oracle headroom.\"\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/paper_framing.md:238:- Two novel failure mechanisms (instance degeneracy + LP compression) + unifying capability trap insight\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/paper_framing.md:245:- **Need**: LoRA rank=8 ablation to confirm fine-tuning degree doesn't drive degeneracy\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/paper_framing.md:249:- **Strongest asset**: Capability trap is a genuinely novel insight — no prior work connects model capability to vanishing TTS headroom via degeneracy\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/ROADMAP.md:6:Structured IE 的 confidence signal 能预测质量（AUROC 0.82, ρ 0.45）但无法改善 greedy decoding。两个失败机制（instance degeneracy + LP compression）+ capability trap 统一解释。详见 paper_framing.md。\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/ROADMAP.md:29:| P2 | Hybrid strategy (degenerate→greedy, non-degen→MBR) | 1-2h | 0 | ⏳ |\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/vc_quartile_analysis/report.md:39:**Note:** CoNLL Q3/Q4 are degenerate (VC=1.0, all 8 samples identical) — 50% of CoNLL instances have perfect agreement, leaving no room for selection.\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/round8_analysis_data_summary.md:43:| tied_fraction (ε=0.05) | **60.3%** | **62.2%** |\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/_project/report/round_7_consistency_de165f.md:67:- Registry exp_freeform_ablation: tied_fraction_constrained = 0.597 = 59.7%\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/_project/report/report.md:39:**Note:** CoNLL Q3/Q4 are degenerate (VC=1.0, all 8 samples identical) — 50% of CoNLL instances have perfect agreement, leaving no room for selection.\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/_project/report/round_7_consistency.md:67:- Registry exp_freeform_ablation: tied_fraction_constrained = 0.597 = 59.7%\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/_project/report/round8_analysis_data_summary.md:43:| tied_fraction (ε=0.05) | **60.3%** | **62.2%** |\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/d112/data/summary.md:3:Strategy: Use greedy for degenerate instances (constant F1 across all samples), MBR selection (highest SJ utility) for non-degenerate instances.\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/d112/data/summary.md:11:Key: Hybrid marginally helps SciERC NER (+0.18pp) but does not beat greedy on CoNLL/RE where degenerate proportion is high. On non-degenerate instances, MBR selection underperforms greedy for CoNLL/RE tasks.\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/exp_vc_quartile_analysis/report/report.md:39:**Note:** CoNLL Q3/Q4 are degenerate (VC=1.0, all 8 samples identical) — 50% of CoNLL instances have perfect agreement, leaving no room for selection.\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_14.md:22:[Omitted long matching line]\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_14.md:40:**S5. Instance degeneracy 量化分析有信息量** [R1-S5, R2 同意]\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_14.md:41:Table 5 的 degeneracy 统计（constant F1/constant utility/oracle gap closed/within-instance ρ）是本文最有价值的实证贡献之一。MBR 社区讨论 utility degradation，但 \"utility IS good (ρ=0.524) yet headroom IS eliminated\" 是更精确的诊断。\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_14.md:67:- Section 1 line 8 用一句话概括差异（\"leaving open\" 三个问题），但未说明 Yao et al. 使用 hard-prompting 而非 fine-tuned models 这一关键方法论差异。如果 instance degeneracy 是 fine-tuning 产物（高 confidence convergence），则本文最核心的 failure mechanism 不存在于 Yao et al. 的设置中——这恰好构成最强差异化论点，但论文未利用。\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_14.md:68:- 行动：Related Work 增加对比段落，将 fine-tuning → low diversity → degeneracy 作为与 Yao et al. 的关键区分。\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_14.md:71:- R2-N2 提出（gap 是 MBR 已知现象的重标签化），R1 REBUT（instance degeneracy ≠ utility mismatch：MBR 文献讨论 utility function 不 align with quality，本文中 SJ utility DOES correlate with F1 within instances (ρ=0.524)，失败来自 headroom elimination）\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_14.md:72:- 分歧点：R2 认为 novelty 有限（2.5/5），R1 认为 degeneracy 是 qualitatively 新机制（3.0/5）\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_14.md:73:- **实质共识**：Contribution #1 应从 \"identifying the gap\" 调整为 \"diagnosing two specific failure mechanisms (instance degeneracy + LP compression) that explain why QE does not translate to selection in fine-tuned IE models\"。需在 Related Work 中明确讨论与 Eikema et al. (2025) MBR utility degradation 的区别。\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_14.md:78:- (2) **Yun et al. (Findings EMNLP 2025)** \"The Price of Format: Diversity Collapse in LLMs\" — format templates → diversity collapse，与 instance degeneracy 话题相关但不同（output-level degeneracy vs token-level diversity）。[ACL Anthology 已确认]\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_14.md:93:**SF3. [CONSENSUS] Scale ablation (4B vs 8B) 证据力不足 + 缺少 4B degeneracy 数据**\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_14.md:95:- 仅 2 个规模点（同一模型家族 Qwen3），scale 范围极窄（同属 small-model regime）。4B 的 constant F1 fraction、oracle headroom 未报告，无法判断 gap 是 task difficulty 还是 degeneracy pattern 驱动。Abstract \"at two model scales (4B and 8B)\" 未限定为 narrow range。\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_14.md:147:- R1 立场：Instance degeneracy 是 qualitatively 不同于 utility mismatch 的新机制。MBR 文献中的失败是 utility function 不 align with human quality；本文中 SJ utility DOES capture quality (within-instance ρ=0.524)，但 degeneracy 消除了 headroom。这不是重标签化。\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_14.md:154:**Q1.** [R1-Q1, R2-Q1] Instance degeneracy 是 fine-tuning artifact 还是 task 固有属性？如果 hard-prompted models（如 Yao et al. 设置）也有 high degeneracy，则结论不同。这直接影响 remedy 方向（diversity-promoting training vs. trained verifiers）。\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_14.md:158:**Q3.** [R1-Q3] MBR within-instance ρ=0.524 对 degenerate instances（F1 方差=0）如何处理？excluded or assigned 0？\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_14.md:197:论文实验设计扎实、统计实践优秀、消融链完整——这些方法论品质本身值得认可。Instance degeneracy 的量化分析和 LP compression 诊断链是有价值的实证贡献。\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_14.md:206:- 如果能在 rebuttal 中 (a) reframe contribution 区分 trivial/non-trivial, (b) 补充 4B degeneracy 数据, (c) 添加缺失文献, 论文适合 **EMNLP 2026 Findings**。\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_15.md:21:[Omitted long matching line]\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_15.md:34:MBR utility 在 non-degenerate instances 上与 F1 正相关（median ρ=0.52），且 MBR 在这些 instances 上 closes 23-41% of oracle gap——证明 MBR 在有 headroom 时 work。Failure 来自 headroom vanishing 而非 utility misalignment，这与 Eikema et al. (2025) 报告的 MBR failure mode 有 qualitative 区别。\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_15.md:55:- **真正的 empirical findings 是**: (a) MBR 转换产生 per-sample ranking 后仍失败（despite within-instance ρ=0.52），因 instance degeneracy 消除 headroom; (b) LP 因 compression 失败（median range 0.041 nats）。\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_15.md:81:**SF1. [共识] Instance degeneracy: fine-tuning recipe artifact 未排除**\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_15.md:83:- LoRA rank=32, dropout=0, 5 epochs（Table 9），SciERC 未用 load_best_model_at_end。8B vs 4B degeneracy 差异（21% vs 10.4%）可能反映 larger model with same epochs overfits faster，而非 capability-intrinsic property。\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_15.md:86:**SF2. [共识] 与 Yao et al. (2026) positioning: 缺少 hard-prompted degeneracy 讨论**\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_15.md:88:- 关键未回答问题：hard-prompted models 是否存在 instance degeneracy？如果否→degeneracy 是 fine-tuning artifact 非 task-intrinsic。这是论文最强差异化论点但未被显式讨论。\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_15.md:125:M4. SciERC checkpoint 未用 load_best_model_at_end，可能增加 degeneracy，需 acknowledge\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_15.md:127:M6. Yun et al. (2025) diversity collapse 与 degeneracy 的联系需显式讨论（1-2 句）\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_15.md:138:6. **Yao et al. 对比**需补充 hard-prompted degeneracy 讨论\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_15.md:153:Q2. [Both] Instance degeneracy 是否对 fine-tuning recipe 敏感（LoRA rank、epochs、dropout、load_best_model_at_end）？\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/review_reports/round_15.md:156:Q5. [R1] Hybrid 策略（degenerate→greedy, non-degenerate→MBR）的 expected gain？\n\n[Showing results with pagination = limit: 50]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6745f76e-d74d-4b80-8f31-9d576877709a","uuid":"38abb63a-cc72-4623-8235-3b1fc8510088","timestamp":"2026-05-16T09:43:04.818Z","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"projects/struct_self_consist_ie/paper_framing.md:9:## Core Claims (4 layers, D112 updated — Main Conference framing with capability trap + degeneracy)\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/paper_framing.md:16:[Omitted long matching line]\nprojects/struct_self_consist_ie/paper_framing.md:18:- **Capability Trap** (unifying insight, D111): Model capability → output convergence → instance degeneracy → vanishing selection headroom. Evidence: CoNLL (91% F